 potash well into 2018, as supported by the recent price increases in several markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/02/06/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q4-2017-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2018 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2018-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chuck Magro","x":"Corporate cost synergies were limited in the first quarter, given that staff reduction notices largely took place in March and we took a $28 million charge for severance this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/08/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2018 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2018-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chuck Magro","x":"I'll have Susan Jones, our President of Phosphate, talk about the synergy delivery and the restructuring and then I can come back and talk a little bit about strategically how we think about our phosphate business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/08/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2018 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2018-05-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chuck Magro","x":"With grower margins strengthening and planting now well under way, we see good demand and firm prices for most crop inputs, which allowed us to increase our annual guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/08/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2019-05-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Frank","x":"…last 12 months, crop protection products that have been imported from China, we've seen inflation on those, both because of the environmental controls that are being put in place and that reflecting in higher costs, and then of course, what were 10% tariffs that have now been turned up to 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2019-05-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Frank","x":"I think if you look across the U.S. market, there is just over $600 million worth of active ingredients that are imported from China, and so you can calculate yourself the impact of that going from 10% to 25% tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2019-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raef Sully","x":"Those commitments are at prices that are in line with our forecast, so we've got 35% ready to go in the spot markets in those areas away from the Gulf that we should see some good price realization in this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2019-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"The themes around the Investor Day will be we will set operational targets for all three of our businesses, and embedded in them will be cost savings, but also our plans to drive up margin enhancement beyond just costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2019-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Wong","x":"Not to steal the thunder away from your analyst day later this month, but could you provide a little bit of a preview on some of the cost savings that you'll be targeting?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2019-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"We are maintaining full year guidance, and we set the first half guidance based on what we've seen through the month of April and then early in May.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2019-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"That's why we raised our guidance level up to make up the difference.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q2","e":"ntr","d":"2019-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ben Isaacson","x":"…how the fall is setting up to look really strong and I was hoping you could frame that or add some goalposts given farmer economics, where dealer and even former inventories and how do we kind of break up ammonia, urea, and nitrates and kind of maybe a trade war resolution, what does that mean?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q2","e":"ntr","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"…we've done in our production businesses in nitrogen and phosphate, but also in potash, take our cost out and optimize the network so there's still some of the full value that we're gonna see from the synergy capture that we've delivered and the incremental work that we outlined at our Investor…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q3","e":"ntr","d":"2019-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Frank","x":"Now going into 2020 as we talked to suppliers and talk to, whether it be third-party suppliers of our major crop protection products or even for our proprietary products business, we're expecting probably more of a normal price increase in that 2%-2.5% range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q3","e":"ntr","d":"2019-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Frank","x":"And so once we got into the busy season, we were able to pass along the price increases or the cost increases through to the farm-gate and that would be our expectation going into 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q3","e":"ntr","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Frank","x":"It put pressure on margins as we were reordering some products, and I think even as you look at our proprietary margins, we've had an impact because of rising cost out of China, both from a third party supply standpoint but also within our proprietary business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q4","e":"ntr","d":"2020-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Pedro Farah","x":"As you recall, we bought in anticipation of China tariffs last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q4","e":"ntr","d":"2020-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"…of $3.8 billion to $4.3 billion in 2020, which assumes a solid growth in Retail earnings, but recognizing that fertilizer prices are likely to continue to be under pressure in the first half of the year, given current levels and the lag in price realization compared to quoted benchmark prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2019 Q4","e":"ntr","d":"2020-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"The upper end of the guidance has, of course, price increases assumed through the year, but that the overall net pricing would be actually less than 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTR 2020 Q2","e":"ntr","d":"2020-08-11","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Wong","x":"So is there anything we should be watching there in terms of impacts on the potash market, potential tariffs, potential sanctions, anything like that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2020 Q2","e":"ntr","d":"2020-08-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"We maintained guidance for our Ag Solutions and Potash segments, and we have raised expectations for Phosphate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2020 Q2","e":"ntr","d":"2020-08-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"And the reason we trimmed our guidance in Nitrogen was purely just on the ammonia and UAN.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2020 Q3","e":"ntr","d":"2020-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Charles Magro","x":"But I think that this year what we've seen, if you look at why we lowered the guidance in retail, there are three drivers to that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2020 Q4","e":"ntr","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chuck Magro","x":"Furthermore, our investments in technology and supply chain enhancements and our ongoing focus on cost reduction also contributed to an improved cash operating coverage ratio in 2020, which declined by 1 percentage point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2021 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2021-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mayo M. Schmidt","x":"When we look at the change that we've gone through, the tariffs the U.S. has applied in China, worked through that, which created obviously an extension of Brazilian exports into that market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2021 Q3","e":"ntr","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pedro Farah","x":"And for potash, we still have opportunities as well for next-gen initiatives and additional projects for cost reduction as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2022 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Seitz","x":"Well, I would say that given the price of commodities, and certainly, the most recent price increases, growers haven't set to maximize yield.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2022 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Joel Jackson","x":"Your Canpotex partner gave some guidance overnight that they're expecting about a $50 a tonne realized price increase in Q2 sequentially but in Q1, you obviously have a lot of pricing that's linked together.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2022 Q2","e":"ntr","d":"2022-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Tarsi","x":"I might add, this past year, very little price increase on seed going into the '22 planning season with it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2022 Q2","e":"ntr","d":"2022-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Tarsi","x":"And I think that we'll see most of our seats supplier I maybe missed that window last year to raise prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/nutrien-ltd-ntr-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2025 Q4","e":"ntr","d":"2026-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Seitz","x":"We surpassed our $200 million annual cost savings target and reduced capital expenditures to $2 billion, well below our Investor Day target of $2.2 billion to $2.3 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/nutrien-ntr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2025 Q4","e":"ntr","d":"2026-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Seitz","x":"We talked about that, that's Latin American restructuring and the Brazil margin improvement plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/nutrien-ntr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2026 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Seitz","x":"…idling blenders, selling of the 5 -- idling 5 blenders have sold 3, the steps that we've taken on cost reduction and reducing head count in that part of the world to focus on collections, the idling of unproductive locations, 64 of them and getting that business into a position where it's albeit…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/nutrien-ntr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2026 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Seitz","x":"So yes, maybe I'll just say a few words about what we're seeing thus far into the year and then hand it over to Mark for our guidance assumptions and what gives us confidence to maintain our guidance range of $1.7 billion to $1.95 billion in EBITDA out of our downstream business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/nutrien-ntr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NTR 2026 Q1","e":"ntr","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Seitz","x":"That's the reason we've maintained our guidance range, but we're not going to, at this stage, in the planting season and in the year, start to make prog